WEBVTT

00:02.520 --> 00:06.573
We shall proceed as Minister Xie advises.

00:08.680 --> 00:16.227
Since Your Highness has given the command, leave this matter to me. I shall handpick a few trusted men and attend to it immediately.

00:19.520 --> 00:25.080
Your Highness must remain composed. As for the rest, this old servant shall arrange everything discreetly.

00:47.760 --> 00:50.400
Make sure it's clean.
Yes, milord.

00:54.680 --> 01:00.360
Have you heard? Chancellor Yu Gong of the Imperial Academy has been convicted of treason by the Imperial City Guard!

01:00.440 --> 01:07.880
Word is he had confederates... yet overnight, every last one vanished without a trace. No one knows where they went.

01:11.520 --> 01:18.160
His Majesty is indisposed today—morning court is cancelled! My Lords, you may disperse.

01:19.440 --> 01:21.500
Understood.

01:22.960 --> 01:27.000
Your Highness, Prince of Jin.

01:28.960 --> 01:34.000
Eunuch Wen.
His Majesty has issued a private summons for Your Highness.

01:34.880 --> 01:37.500
Then I shall trouble you to lead the way, Eunuch.

01:44.680 --> 01:53.240
Eunuch Wen... Father is not resting in his bedchamber?
His Majesty is in the Imperial Elixir Chamber, refining new pills.

01:55.000 --> 02:00.320
Does the Eunuch happen to know why Father summoned me in private?
This humble servant could not possibly know, Your Highness.
